{
  "_comment": "Figma group 261:282. FIVE icons here are painted #FF0000 — Figma's default red — on glyphs with no reason to be red (Link, Realized Gains, a cog, a window+wrench). Every other icon in the library is black/gray-12/gray-10, so this reads as a leftover override rather than intent. They stay literal, which makes the gallery show the defect rather than hide it, and it is flagged on Guides > Status. `Component 56` and `Component 57` are skipped entirely: Figma default names, so there is nothing to call them. `fluent:window-wrench-48-filled` and `mdi:cog-transfer` are Iconify paste-ins renamed to what they draw.",
